   "narrated": "Ibn 'Abbas reported Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) as saying:",
   "text": "Gabriel taught me to recite in one style. I replied to him and kept asking him to give more (styles), till he reached seven modes (of recitation). Ibn Shibab said: It has reached me that these seven styles are essentially one, not differing about what is permitted and what is forbidden.",
   "english_full": "Ibn 'Abbas reported Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) as saying:\n\nGabriel taught me to recite in one style. I replied to him and kept asking him to give more (styles), till he reached seven modes (of recitation). Ibn Shibab said: It has reached me that these seven styles are essentially one, not differing about what is permitted and what is forbidden.",
